om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note si/release-1.0/gate_si_1_0.om: Pure seeded-OM-2 End-to-End Gate for Sovereign Intelligence 1.0 Release Toolkit.
note
note Build:
note   seed/out/omc < si/release-1.0/gate_si_1_0.om > gate_si_1_0 && chmod +x gate_si_1_0
note Run:
note   gate_si_1_0 OMC_BIN REPO_ROOT SCRATCH_DIR
note
note Verifies fail-closed:
note   1. Compiler SHA-256 pin matches REPO_ROOT/seed/out/omc.sha256 (exit 69 if mismatched) + 1-byte tamper control.
note   2. Deterministic 2x compilation of si_release_gate.om and export_standalone.om (zero stderr, identical SHA-256).
note   3. si_release_gate.om:
note      - REFUSES real live si/release-1.0/MANIFEST-1.0.tsv (exit 1, REFUSED 1.0-HOLD)
note      - ACCEPTS synthetic all-green 10-repo manifest (exit 0, STAMP 1.0-READY)
note      - ACCEPTS synthetic 10-repo manifest with valid WAIVER- on NOT_RUN (exit 0, waived=1)
note      - 7 negative controls (unwaived NOT_RUN, unwaivable FAIL with forged waiver,
note        unwaivable MISSING_IMPLEMENTATION with forged waiver, missing required repo,
note        bad short commit SHA, mismatched omc SHA-256 pin, dishonest PROPOSED+PASS) all REFUSED (exit 1).
note   4. export_standalone.om:
note      - Real STANDALONE-REPOS.tsv exports deterministically across 2 separate runs (identical stdout & artifacts)
note      - Real verify passes on rtl8127-omega and tensorfold-omega
note      - Synthetic export verifies FIPS 180-4 SHA-256 KAT ("abc"), 60-Second Omega Rosetta Card,
note        Zig ABI v2 omega2_plugin.zig layout, and verify PASS
note      - 4 tamper/safety negative controls (1-byte source tamper, 1-byte UPSTREAM_PIN tree_sha256 tamper,
note        missing required source_dir, path traversal ../etc) all CAUGHT (exit 1).
note
note Exit codes: 0 = SI_1_0_GATE PASS, 1 = FAIL, 2 = bad usage/setup, 69 = compiler pin mismatch.

